# data/content.json and public/uploads/ are intentionally NOT ignored.
# Most free Node hosts wipe the disk on every sleep/restart/redeploy, so
# this app's content is meant to be committed once you're happy with a
# page — that way a redeploy just re-checks-out the same files instead
# of losing them. See "Deploying" in README.md.
